abstract: >-
  Julia code and numerical data used to generate the figures for the paper
  "Scaling theory of decoherence in Dicke superradiance". The repository
  contains stochastic-trajectory and mean-field calculations together with
  the notebooks used to produce the source plots.
keywords:
  - Dicke superradiance
  - dephasing
  - spontaneous emission
  - stochastic trajectories
  - mean-field theory
  - Julia
